{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PoYo AI - Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS API",
    "description": "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS API 使用预设音色、行内表达标签和可选的风格指令，将文本转换为单人或双人语音。可设置可选的语言，并返回 MP3、WAV 或 Opus 音频。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.poyo.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/generate/submit": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "提交 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS 任务",
        "description": "将文本输入转换为富有表现力的语音音频。",
        "operationId": "submitGemini31FlashTtsTask",
        "tags": [
          "Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "single-audio-tags-mp3": {
                  "summary": "带音频标签的单人语音",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3-1-flash-tts",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "Good morning, team. [short pause] Our release is stable, and the customer demo starts in ten minutes.",
                      "style_instructions": "Warm, confident product narrator with clear pacing.",
                      "voice": "Kore",
                      "temperature": 1,
                      "output_format": "mp3"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "multilingual-store-wav": {
                  "summary": "多语言单音色输出",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3-1-flash-tts",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "English: Your order is ready for pickup.\nSpanish: Su pedido esta listo para recoger.\nFrench: Votre commande est prete a etre retiree.",
                      "style_instructions": "Friendly store assistant voice, natural and concise.",
                      "voice": "Zephyr",
                      "language_code": "English (US)",
                      "temperature": 1,
                      "output_format": "wav"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "two-speaker-podcast-ogg": {
                  "summary": "双人播客对话",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3-1-flash-tts",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "Host: Welcome back to Launch Notes. [laughing] Today's build finally passed.\nGuest: Great news. Let's keep the update clear and calm for users.",
                      "style_instructions": "Conversational podcast tone with distinct speaker energy.",
                      "speakers": [
                        {
                          "speaker_id": "Host",
                          "voice": "Charon"
                        },
                        {
                          "speaker_id": "Guest",
                          "voice": "Kore"
                        }
                      ],
                      "temperature": 1,
                      "output_format": "ogg_opus"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未授权",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "所有 API 接口都需要 Bearer Token 认证。\n\n创建 API Key：登录 PoYo，进入 **仪表盘 → API 密钥**（[poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key](https://poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key)），点击创建 Key。\n\n在请求头中添加：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SubmitRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "input"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型标识符。",
            "enum": [
              "gemini-3-1-flash-tts"
            ],
            "example": "gemini-3-1-flash-tts"
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "接收结果通知的 Webhook 回调 URL",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/callback"
          },
          "input": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Gemini31FlashTtsInput"
          }
        }
      },
      "Gemini31FlashTtsInput": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要转换为语音的文本。支持在行内用自然语言指定风格、语速、口音和情绪，并支持 [sigh]、[laughing]、[whispering]、[short pause] 等表现力音频标签。多人合成时，在每行前加上与 speakers[].speaker_id 匹配的说话人别名作为前缀。",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 50000,
            "example": "Good morning, team. [short pause] Our release is stable, and the customer demo starts in ten minutes."
          },
          "style_instructions": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "可选的风格、表达方式、语速、口音、语气或情绪指令，作用于整个请求。",
            "example": "Warm, confident product narrator with clear pacing."
          },
          "voice": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VoiceEnum"
          },
          "language_code": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LanguageCodeEnum"
          },
          "speakers": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "用于对话的说话人对象，必须恰好两个。设置后将忽略顶层的 voice。每个 speaker_id 只能包含字母、数字和下划线，不能有空白字符，在请求内唯一，并须在 text 中用作前缀。",
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpeakerConfig"
            }
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "控制语音变化程度，取值 0 到 2。值越高，表达越多变。",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "default": 1,
            "example": 1
          },
          "output_format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "音频输出格式。mp3 体积小，推荐用于播放；wav 未压缩，适合后期制作；ogg_opus 兼顾质量与体积。",
            "enum": [
              "mp3",
              "wav",
              "ogg_opus"
            ],
            "default": "mp3",
            "example": "mp3"
          }
        }
      },
      "SpeakerConfig": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "voice",
          "speaker_id"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "voice": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VoiceEnum"
          },
          "speaker_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "别名，只能包含字母、数字和下划线，不能有空白字符，在请求内唯一，在 text 字段中作为前缀用于标识该说话人。",
            "example": "Host"
          }
        }
      },
      "VoiceEnum": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Gemini TTS 预设音色。",
        "enum": [
          "Achernar",
          "Achird",
          "Algenib",
          "Algieba",
          "Alnilam",
          "Aoede",
          "Autonoe",
          "Callirrhoe",
          "Charon",
          "Despina",
          "Enceladus",
          "Erinome",
          "Fenrir",
          "Gacrux",
          "Iapetus",
          "Kore",
          "Laomedeia",
          "Leda",
          "Orus",
          "Pulcherrima",
          "Puck",
          "Rasalgethi",
          "Sadachbia",
          "Sadaltager",
          "Schedar",
          "Sulafat",
          "Umbriel",
          "Vindemiatrix",
          "Zephyr",
          "Zubenelgenubi"
        ],
        "default": "Kore",
        "example": "Kore"
      },
      "LanguageCodeEnum": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "多语言合成的语言。省略时，模型根据文本自动检测。",
        "enum": [
          "Arabic (Egypt)",
          "Bangla (Bangladesh)",
          "Dutch (Netherlands)",
          "English (India)",
          "English (US)",
          "French (France)",
          "German (Germany)",
          "Hindi (India)",
          "Indonesian (Indonesia)",
          "Italian (Italy)",
          "Japanese (Japan)",
          "Korean (South Korea)",
          "Marathi (India)",
          "Polish (Poland)",
          "Portuguese (Brazil)",
          "Romanian (Romania)",
          "Russian (Russia)",
          "Spanish (Spain)",
          "Tamil (India)",
          "Telugu (India)",
          "Thai (Thailand)",
          "Turkish (Turkey)",
          "Ukrainian (Ukraine)",
          "Vietnamese (Vietnam)",
          "Afrikaans (South Africa)",
          "Albanian (Albania)",
          "Amharic (Ethiopia)",
          "Arabic (World)",
          "Armenian (Armenia)",
          "Azerbaijani (Azerbaijan)",
          "Basque (Spain)",
          "Belarusian (Belarus)",
          "Bulgarian (Bulgaria)",
          "Burmese (Myanmar)",
          "Catalan (Spain)",
          "Cebuano (Philippines)",
          "Chinese Mandarin (China)",
          "Chinese Mandarin (Taiwan)",
          "Croatian (Croatia)",
          "Czech (Czech Republic)",
          "Danish (Denmark)",
          "English (Australia)",
          "English (UK)",
          "Estonian (Estonia)",
          "Filipino (Philippines)",
          "Finnish (Finland)",
          "French (Canada)",
          "Galician (Spain)",
          "Georgian (Georgia)",
          "Greek (Greece)",
          "Gujarati (India)",
          "Haitian Creole (Haiti)",
          "Hebrew (Israel)",
          "Hungarian (Hungary)",
          "Icelandic (Iceland)",
          "Javanese (Java)",
          "Kannada (India)",
          "Konkani (India)",
          "Lao (Laos)",
          "Latin (Vatican City)",
          "Latvian (Latvia)",
          "Lithuanian (Lithuania)",
          "Luxembourgish (Luxembourg)",
          "Macedonian (North Macedonia)",
          "Maithili (India)",
          "Malagasy (Madagascar)",
          "Malay (Malaysia)",
          "Malayalam (India)",
          "Mongolian (Mongolia)",
          "Nepali (Nepal)",
          "Norwegian Bokmal (Norway)",
          "Norwegian Nynorsk (Norway)",
          "Odia (India)",
          "Pashto (Afghanistan)",
          "Persian (Iran)",
          "Portuguese (Portugal)",
          "Punjabi (India)",
          "Serbian (Serbia)",
          "Sindhi (India)",
          "Sinhala (Sri Lanka)",
          "Slovak (Slovakia)",
          "Slovenian (Slovenia)",
          "Spanish (Latin America)",
          "Spanish (Mexico)",
          "Swahili (Kenya)",
          "Swedish (Sweden)",
          "Urdu (Pakistan)"
        ],
        "example": "English (US)"
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200,
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "task_id",
              "status",
              "created_time"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "task_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "task-unified-1757165031-uyujaw3d"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["not_started", "running", "finished", "failed"],
                "example": "not_started",
                "description": "任务状态。提交后立即返回时始终为 `not_started`。后续状态请通过[查询任务状态](/zh/api-manual/task-management/status)接口或 `callback_url` 获取。\n\n- `not_started`：排队中，等待处理\n- `running`：生成中\n- `finished`：已完成，结果在 `files` 或 `output` 中\n- `failed`：失败，详情见 `error_message`"
              },
              "created_time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time",
                "example": "2026-06-25T10:30:00"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
